Prefixes and qualifiers on properties that do not take them. The toolchain ignores a qualifier on `description`; krusty-toolchain refuses it.
--- project.yaml
modules: [a]
--- a/module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
test-layout: default
description@jvm: x
--- krusty-refusal
error	a/module.yaml:3:1: ERROR: krusty-toolchain reads JVM modules only; it refuses the qualifier `@jvm` on `description`
error	a/module.yaml:2:1: ERROR: Unknown property `test-layout`
